  "summary": "林老板从基层业务员升任主管，后经营进口与塑胶加工扩厂。作者认为命身会吉及庚申、己未、戊午三限吉化，使忌煞可用，成就伴随工厂经营奔波。原文先称武破亥命，后称巳命，位置自相矛盾，不能合并为已知单一命盘；先后天或对象及双权夹禄载体未齐之处亦保留。",
  "summary_en": "Mr. Lin progressed from sales to management, then expanded imported machinery and plastics manufacturing. The author attributes success with continuing toil to favorable Life and Body configurations and the Geng Shen, Ji Wei and Wu Wu cycles. The text first places Wu Qu and Po Jun at Hai, then at Si; this contradiction is preserved rather than resolved into one chart. Favorable transformations of natal and cycle Life and Career Palaces are recorded where explicit. Unassigned double Quan and alternative natal-or-cycle targets are not reconstructed.",
